3. Native media libraries (libmpv, FFmpeg) bundled by media_kit
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Video playback uses media_kit (MIT License, Copyright (c) 2021 & onwards
Hitesh Kumar Saini, https://github.com/media-kit/media-kit). On Android, iOS
and macOS the media_kit_libs_* packages add prebuilt native libraries to the
app. Web builds contain none of them. These libraries are not part of this
repository; the build downloads them from the releases below.

Versions pinned by pubspec.lock in this repository:

  media_kit_libs_android_video 1.3.8
    https://github.com/media-kit/libmpv-android-video-build/releases/tag/v1.1.7
    (default-arm64-v8a.jar, default-armeabi-v7a.jar, default-x86_64.jar,
    default-x86.jar)
  media_kit_libs_ios_video 1.1.4
    https://github.com/media-kit/libmpv-darwin-build/releases/tag/v0.6.0
    (libmpv-xcframeworks_v0.6.0_ios-universal-video-default.tar.gz)
  media_kit_libs_macos_video 1.1.4
    https://github.com/media-kit/libmpv-darwin-build/releases/tag/v0.6.0
    (libmpv-xcframeworks_v0.6.0_macos-universal-video-default.tar.gz)

All three use the "default" flavor, which is built without GPL and without
non-free code:

  Component     License (SPDX)                         Android v1.1.7   iOS/macOS v0.6.0
  mpv (libmpv)  LGPL-2.1-or-later (-Dgpl=false)        git 78d43740 *   0.36.0
  FFmpeg        LGPL-3.0-or-later (--enable-version3,  6.0              6.0
                without --enable-gpl, --enable-nonfree)
  FriBidi       LGPL-2.1-or-later                      1.0.12           1.0.13
  uchardet      MPL-1.1 OR GPL-2.0-or-later OR         -                0.0.8
                LGPL-2.1-or-later (used under LGPL-2.1-or-later)
  libass        ISC                                    0.17.1           0.17.1
  FreeType      FTL                                    2.13.0           2.13.2
  libpng        libpng-2.0                             -                1.6.40 **
  HarfBuzz      MIT                                    7.2.0            8.1.1
  Mbed TLS      Apache-2.0                             3.4.0            3.4.1
  dav1d         BSD-2-Clause                           1.2.0            1.2.1
  libxml2       MIT                                    2.10.3           2.11.5
  media-kit-android-helper  MIT                        git 42054e5d     -

  *  mpv commit 78d43740f52db817d98bcf24fb30a76ab6fa13ff (2023-10-14).
