FreeType credit, as the FreeType License requires: Portions of this software
are copyright (c) 2023 The FreeType Project (www.freetype.org). All rights
reserved.

Versions come from buildscripts/include/depinfo.sh (Android, tag v1.1.7) and
downloads.lock (iOS/macOS, tag v0.6.0) in the build repositories. Project
homes: https://mpv.io, https://ffmpeg.org, https://github.com/fribidi/fribidi,
https://www.freedesktop.org/wiki/Software/uchardet/,
https://github.com/libass/libass, https://freetype.org,
http://www.libpng.org/pub/png/libpng.html, https://github.com/harfbuzz/harfbuzz,
https://github.com/Mbed-TLS/mbedtls, https://code.videolan.org/videolan/dav1d,
https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/libxml2,
https://github.com/media-kit/media-kit-android-helper

The app does not link these components into its own code. It loads them at
run time as separate shared libraries: on Android, libmpv.so (FFmpeg, FriBidi
and the other components are linked into it); on iOS and macOS, one dynamic
framework per library inside the xcframeworks. A user can replace them with
modified, interface-compatible builds.

